stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Building : Git Push Trigger
    Building --> Testing : Compile Success
    Building --> Failed : Compile Error
    Testing --> Deploying : Tests Pass
    Testing --> Failed : Test Failure
    Deploying --> Active : Health Check OK
    Deploying --> Failed : Deployment Timeout
    Failed --> Idle : Acknowledge & Fix
    Active --> [*] : Terminated
